main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ throwing conversion: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ noexcept conversion: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ direct binding: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ temporary of scalar: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ temporary through throwing conversion: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] line \d+ derived to base: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.7\] line \d+ not constructible: SUCCESS$
